{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53522","headline":"题从生假山 · 薛涛","name":"题从生假山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宅相多能好自持，爱山攒石倚庭陲。\n铜梁公阜□□□，□□□□□□□。\n（见北京图书馆藏《分门纂类唐歌诗》宋刻残本，转录自张篷舟《薛涛诗笺·後记》。\n《宛委别藏》本将此诗删弃。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛涛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53522.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53522","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}